OL,3,AEquinor says it may stop investing in
OL,4,AUK if oil and gas fields do not get
OL,5,Ago-ahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FOil giant Equinor has warned it may
OL,8,Fshun further investments in the UK if
OL,9,Fnew oil and gas fields at Rosebank and
OL,10,FJackdaw are not approved.
OL,12,F"The question will be: is the UK
OL,13,Finvestable in the future? I hope it
OL,14,Fwill not come to that," said Anders
OL,15,FOpedal, boss of the Norwegian state oil
OL,16,Fcompany which is part owner of the
OL,17,Fsites.
OL,19,FHe told the BBC the company would "have
OL,20,Fto take a hard view about it" if a
OL,21,Fdecision was made to reject new
OL,22,Fdrilling.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
