OL,3,AEquinor says it may stop investing in
OL,4,AUK if oil and gas fields do not get
OL,5,Ago-ahead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe warning comes as the UK government
OL,8,Fis set to decide whether or not to
OL,9,Fgrant final approval to extract oil and
OL,10,Fgas at Rosebank and Jackdaw.
